# Portfolio review weights

When editing or scoring this site, use `.cursor/agents/`.

**Blocking (same importance; both must stay at 10/10):** `aesthetics`, `personability`

**Secondary (only if the blocking pair still holds):** employer 10s scan, impressiveness, preciseness, eye-catching (poster + tasteful motion + CRT-native 3D)

If a secondary fix would flatten CRT craft or the old site’s first-person whimsy (profession cycle, “corner of the internet” bio, hover-surprise, About me, power-button ghost), refuse it or rephrase so aesthetics and personability do not drop.

Personability canon: first-person, computer/DOS, making-stuff curiosity — not a resume abstract as the hero.
